        "original_id": "352fd3b0-5eeb-500c-8cf9-1cabc3667950",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Anna Camp, Maggie Kiley, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, Amelia Rose Blaire\n- Films: Pitch Perfect, Pitch Perfect 2, Pitch Perfect 3, Caught\n- Organizations: Barden University, The Bellas\n- Topics: film roles, cast, plot setting\n\nFacts:\n- Anna Camp played Aubrey Posen in the film \"Pitch Perfect\" (2012).\n- \"Pitch Perfect 2\" centers on the fictional Barden University and The Bellas, an all-female a cappella singing group.\n- \"Caught\" is a 2015 American psychological thriller film directed by Maggie Kiley.\n- \"Caught\" stars Anna Camp, Samuel Page, Stefanie Scott, and Amelia Rose Blaire.\n- Anna Camp reprised Aubrey Posen in \"Pitch Perfect 2\" (2015).\n- Anna Camp was announced to play Aubrey Posen in the upcoming film \"Pitch Perfect 3\" (2017).",
